Third-party material
====================

Base architecture acknowledgment
--------------------------------
The rating model is built on the sunny-rework architecture by sunnyxxy
(https://github.com/sunnyxxy/Star-Rating-Rebirth). SPM Rating supplies its own
parser and numerical implementation of the model.

Example charts and audio
------------------------
The P/Q charts and click tracks in examples/ were generated for this project.

